                                "sense_id": "3670e071-6ef0-3b3d-a507-77fe96e4dede",
                                "text": "Moreover, art can think “transversally” with scientific functions in artistic ways, just as science can think transversally with artistic sensations in scientific ways. I would argue that such transversal thinking is the possible […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "28d8971f-a13f-47de-8162-9d92d732918d",
                                "sense_id": "3670e071-6ef0-3b3d-a507-77fe96e4dede",
                                "text": "Urging us to think transversally across three ecological registers – mental, social and environmental – Guattari emphasises the necessity to confront our enslavement in global capitalism."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b3b5a64a-7c9f-4d16-b821-bcf8ce4146e8",
